<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55570" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφύω</span></b> , aor. 1 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έφῡσα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>implant,
				insert</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φύσις νεῦρα] εἰς τὰς σάρκας
					κατέφυσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					1.18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.11
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, aor. 2
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ έφυν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			 (also in part. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυέν</span> Id.): pf. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέφυκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.442c
				</span></i>
			:—<i>to be inserted</i>, of muscles, nerves, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.563
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				7.185
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UP</u>
				13.12
			</span></i> (pres.
			
				Act.
			 in same sense, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.240
			</span></i>); <i>penetrate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν πεπονθυῖαν σάρκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					18(2).599
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>to be produced</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὸ σῶμα</span> Plu.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>overrun</i> a country, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i></div>
